- Hey, Cincinnati, I hit the board!

00:00:23.083 --> 00:00:25.208
- INTERCEPTED! And it’s coming back!

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:25.708
- AH!

00:00:27.541 --> 00:00:28.208
- You did it, Kirk.

00:00:28.208 --> 00:00:29.416
