00:00:44.833 --> 00:00:45.916
- Hey, man, you do whatever you want at this point. 

00:00:45.958 --> 00:00:46.458
I don’t care.

00:00:46.458 --> 00:00:48.208
- THIS IS NORMALLY WHEN I STOP. 

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:50.083
- Watch this, haters. Swish.

00:00:50.291 --> 00:00:51.375
- No, I prove the haters wrong.

00:00:51.416 --> 00:00:52.416
