00:00:52.458 --> 00:00:55.500
- I’m Lamar Jackson, and I’m not afraid to die.

00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:56.500
- CHECK DOWN! CHECK DOWN! 

00:00:57.291 --> 00:00:58.208
Wait, where’d he come from?

00:00:58.500 --> 00:00:59.833
